  "prefLabel": "Env-A 621.08 Opportunity for Response",
  "priorExpiration": "2003-02-22",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 621.08 Opportunity for Response. The department shall provide a copy of all written comments and requests for a public hearing to the applicant upon request. Within 10 working days of the close of the comment period specified in Env-A 621.02(d)(5), Env-A 621.03, or Env-A 621.04(c)(9), the applicant may file with the department a written response to any of the written comments received during the comment period.\n\nSource. #1710, eff 2-19-81; ss by #2332, eff 4-29-83; ss by #2938, eff 12-27-84; ss by #5033, eff 12-27-90; ss by #5989, eff 2-22-95 (formerly Env-A 205.05); EXPIRED: 2-22-03\n\nNew. #8129, eff 7-28-04 (formerly Env-A 205.08); ss by #10175, eff 9-1-12; ss by #13510, eff 12-17-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a600.html"
